    "tactics": "",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Slam [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 6 + Melee Combat 2), Reach: 10 ft.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 8 damage (4 + 4 Str) + 2 fire damage (Half DR).</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 8 damage, DR halved (round up) + 2 fire damage; target gains Singed condition.</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 3:</strong> 8 damage, DR halved (round up) + 2 fire damage; target gains Ignited condition.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Rock Throw [Combat]: Ranged attack (Dex 3 + Ranged Combat 1), Range: 40/80 ft.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 10 damage (7 + 3 Dex). (Short Range)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 10 damage, DR halved (round up); target knocked Prone.</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Heat Aura: Creatures starting their turn within 5 feet take 2 fire damage (Half DR). Powerful Build: The Ember Kin counts as Huge for carrying, pushing, dragging, and lifting.</p>",
